ARTOMETRICS GLOSSARY — PLACEHOLDER STUB
This is not a binary Adobe Illustrator file.
It is a text brief saved as .ai so an agent can find it next to the HTML starter.
Do not expect Illustrator to open it as vectors or layers.

Style: Bauhaus
Board: /styles/bauhaus
Companions: bauhaus-starter.html, bauhaus-study.ai, bauhaus-study.psd

Artboards
1. A horizontal board, 2400 × 1600 px, ground #f3f1ea.
2. A modular grid, 12 columns. Black bars mark two of the divisions.
3. One red circle, one blue rectangle, one yellow bar. All of them snap to the grid.
4. One word, lowercase, a plain grotesque: "study". No script, no outline.

Rules
No gradients, no shadows, no texture.
Do not imitate a specific Bayer, Moholy-Nagy, or Albers sheet.
Note in the margin: Universal (1925) was an experiment. Helvetica (1957) is Swiss, not Bauhaus.
Colors: #e31c23, #0047ab, #f5c400, #111111.
